flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Initialize gap and swapped flag]
    B --> C[Shrink gap]
    C --> D[Forward gap comparison pass]
    D --> E[Backward comparison pass]
    E --> F{Any swaps?}
    F -->|No| G[Stop]
    F -->|Yes| H{Gap > 1?}
    H -->|Yes| C
    H -->|No| I[Continue final gap-1 passes]
    I --> J{Any swaps?}
    J -->|No| G
    J -->|Yes| I
